⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
273 calories 24g protein (for the entire pint, including mix-ins)

Coffee Coffee BuzzBuzzBuzz Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 135 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk
- 40-45g @Lakanto Monk Fruit Sweetener
- 5g (1 tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- 1 @Cometeer coffee concentrate pod (linked in bio - get 20 free cups using my link)
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
*feel free to sub the pod for 1 tbsp of instant coffee or an espresso shot
Mix-ins:
- 30g chocolate covered espresso beans, chopped
273 cal 27g C, 8g F, 24g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the chopped espresso beans
7. Run the “Mix-in” cycle

